00:28:57.757 --> 00:29:00.380
It happened when I was on my way out

00:29:00.380 --> 00:29:03.130
so I think what has happened is is that

00:29:03.130 --> 00:29:05.170
the Attorney General has classified them

00:29:05.170 --> 00:29:08.520
and they're now making
the, the appropriate steps

00:29:08.520 --> 00:29:11.570
which means you can go
after their finances,

00:29:11.570 --> 00:29:13.678
you can freeze their finances.

00:29:13.678 --> 00:29:16.139
And everybody involved.

00:29:16.139 --> 00:29:18.570
- So with that in mind.
- So accounts.

